=== B01.1 deterministic RED for KFF-B01-NEW-01 (guardian with no progress for ever) ===
date: 2026-09-17T21:06:37+08:00
baseline HEAD: 752042bc466b10b07cad455757a41bb10bbaf39f  (branch codex/facebook-foundation)

variant under test: apps/agent/src/guardian.ts replaced by HEAD's version (sha256 78c0c9931176d0ba8da2b86547593bb45dd3a2e76636adf4b0ac32ba00779bf1)
plus one shim, and nothing else: the sealed fixture arming (guardianHangPoints / insideAgentProcessTests / guardianHangInjection
and the two lines that copy the point into the child's allowlisted environment). The child, the protocol, the journal and the controller are the fixed ones.
The shim adds no liveness, deadline, termination or settle logic, so a child that stops progressing still leaves runGuardian pending for ever - which is the defect.

expected: every case fails by hitting its own deadline instead of settling.

